::ALG1_U02_L01_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: ALG1_U02_L01_Q01
MLA Standard: No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.
Question:
Solve x + 5 = 12.
{
=A. x = 7#Subtract 5 from both sides.
~B. x = 17#This adds 5 instead of subtracting 5.
~C. x = 5#This is the number added to x, not the solution.
~D. x = 12#This repeats the right side without isolating x.
}


