::ALG1_U02_L01_Quiz_Q25::
Question ID: ALG1_U02_L01_Q25
MLA Standard: No new primary MLA standard; prerequisite support.
Question:
Which check confirms the solution x = 13 for x + 12 = 25?
{
~A. 13 - 12 = 25#This changes the operation in the original equation.
=B. 13 + 12 = 25#Substituting 13 for x makes the original equation true.
~C. 25 + 12 = 13#This reverses the relationship and is false.
~D. 12 - 13 = 25#This changes both the operation and the order.
}
